# --- design binaries live outside git (Figma/exports too big for repo) ---
*.fig
*.zip
*.key

# --- audio never enters this repository, on any path ---
# Policy: docs/CORPUS_ETHICS.md — features are kept, source audio is deleted and
# never redistributed. The rules above were path-scoped, which let
# data/phase2_refresh_lekcja5/raw/ (15 commercial tracks) reach a public repo.
# These are format-scoped so no future path can repeat it.
*.mp3
*.wav
*.aiff
*.aif
*.flac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
